{"unit_id":"ljnljn2005__dsh-clawbot-notify#card-zh","repo":"ljnljn2005/dsh-clawbot-notify","commit":"e58c4a7d41bf6d696f4ae35c2e6d4a861d011d23","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clawbot-notify（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 DSH 任务状态和会话交互接入个人微信。它监听 agent 完成、报错和等待用户选择等事件，通过 ilink 向微信主动发送通知；扫码登录后可复用本地账号凭据。启用双向控制后，还能从微信发送文字驱动 agent、查看和切换会话、停止任务，并用 /choose 回答等待中的问题。适合希望离开电脑时了解任务进度或通过手机继续与 DSH 会话的人。需要个人微信扫码登录及可用的 Weixin ClawBot 服务；额外配置 token 为可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:300-347","lib/index.js:1150-1240","lib/login.js:118-149","lib/send.js:59-82"]}
{"unit_id":"ljnljn2005__dsh-clawbot-notify#card-en","repo":"ljnljn2005/dsh-clawbot-notify","commit":"e58c4a7d41bf6d696f4ae35c2e6d4a861d011d23","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-clawbot-notify connects DSH alerts and session control to WeChat. It reports completed tasks, errors, and questions, with QR login and local account storage. When enabled, messages can start agent work, switch sessions, stop tasks, or answer questions. Requires Weixin ClawBot login.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:300-347","lib/index.js:1150-1240","lib/login.js:118-149","lib/send.js:59-82"]}
